@startuml
!include _style.iuml
autonumber
actor Admin
participant "Halaman Login" as UI
participant "Flask\n/admin/login" as F
participant "Session" as S
Admin -> UI : Buka halaman login
UI -> F : GET /admin/login
F --> UI : Tampilkan form login
Admin -> UI : Isi username & password, klik Masuk
UI -> F : POST /admin/login
F -> F : Periksa username & password
alt Kredensial valid
  F -> S : Simpan username ke session
  F --> UI : Redirect ke /dashboard
  UI --> Admin : Tampilkan dashboard
else Kredensial tidak valid
  F --> UI : Flash "Username atau Password salah"
  UI --> Admin : Tampilkan pesan kesalahan
end
@enduml
